{
  "slug": "ac-artifact-workflow",
  "name": "Ac Artifact Workflow",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Artifact-driven development workflow inspired by Google Antigravity. Produces task lists, implementation plans, and walkthroughs to keep you engaged during AI-assisted development.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `adr-manager` (Add Architecture Decision Record (ADR) entries to an ADR file), `implementation-plan-creator` (Create the implementation plan artifact from an approved task list), `task-list-creator` (Create or update the task list artifact from gathered requirements), `walkthrough-creator` (Create and maintain the walkthrough artifact during implementation)\n- **Commands** (1): `build` (Initiate artifact-driven development workflow)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ac-artifact-workflow@claude-community` from `AlteredCraft/claude-code-plugins` (`plugins/artifact-workflow`).",
